      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You cannot use both SDK3 packages in one project!\nIt was clearly told in instructions. You should use SDK3 World ONLY for world buildings, and SDK3 Avatar should ONLY used for avatars.\nOtherwise we have universal SDK3 for everyone, right? But VRChat Devs made both seperated, and you tried to merge both to ONE SDK3.\nYou did wrong here.\nI know SDK2 can used for Avatar and World (there is just 1 SDK2 pack) but SDK3 not. So you must start over again and get only SDK3 Avatar package, then you will not have this problem for your avatars and should work normal.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
